<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- CC-115 B3: written to finalise the verifier rotation the day its four-day delay matured
     (2026-09-04 05:36:24Z). applyFraudProofVerifier() is permissionless and takes no arguments, so
     it could only ever finalise the verifier the aggregator owner had already proposed and that had
     already served its full delay -- there was no decision left to make.

     IT DID NOT DO THAT. Tx 0x9add3d63... applied it at 05:37:12Z, 48 s after readyAt and before
     this job's next hourly tick; the 05:11Z run still saw it pending and the 06:11Z run already saw
     it applied. That was not an outside party -- the signer is this repo's own .env.sepolia deploy
     key, i.e. someone ran apply-verifier-rotation.mjs by hand. This job observed the whole thing and
     broadcast nothing. Its trigger fired reliably; its broadcast path has still never been
     exercised, so do not read a green run as proof that it would apply a rotation.

     WHAT IT IS NOW: a drift guard. The script fails loudly on a disarm, on a different active
     verifier, or on a later rotation proposing an address it is not pinned to. Repoint the expected
     verifier before any future rotation, or it goes red on a correct chain state.

     WHY LOCAL AND NOT THE WORKFLOW: .github/workflows/apply-verifier-rotation.yml exists and is
     correct, but GitHub Actions `schedule` is delivered unreliably here -- sparsely for sub-hourly
     crons and hours late for daily ones (measured; see deploy/README-heartbeat.md) -- so it is not a
     deadline guarantee. The local heartbeat is the primary trigger.

     Hourly, not daily: a laptop is not always awake at a given hour. Every run before maturity is a
     cheap read that exits 0.

     Install and verify: deploy/README-heartbeat.md -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>io.aastar.dvt-apply-rotation</string>

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/jason/Dev/aastar/YetAnotherAA-Validator/deploy/local-heartbeat.sh</string>
    <string>apply</string>
  </array>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/jason/Dev/aastar/YetAnotherAA-Validator</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/Users/jason/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/jason</string>
  </dict>

  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>3600</integer>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/jason/Dev/aastar/YetAnotherAA-Validator/deploy/.run/launchd-apply-rotation.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/jason/Dev/aastar/YetAnotherAA-Validator/deploy/.run/launchd-apply-rotation.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
